error[L0404]: `(entry int)` does not implement `ord`
 --> check/generic_order_field.knv:7:10
  |
7 |   (sort! entries))
  |          ^^^^^^^ this needs `ord`
  |
  = note: `ord` is never inferred for a struct, so the struct needs a written `derive`
  = help: add `(derive entry clone copy partial-eq eq hash show ord)` to compare fields in this order: `key`, then `count`
  = help: to sort by one field instead, use `sort-by!` with the field keyword `:key`
  = note: run `knave doc L0404` for an explanation
